[1m[38;5;231mHow should the store behave when localStorage is unavailable or throws?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mDegrade silently (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mFall back to a no-op in-memory store; the app works, prefs just don't persist. Private browsing and quota errors [39m
     [38;5;246mnever break login.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Throw to the caller
     [38;5;246mSurface the error so callers decide. More explicit, but every call site needs a try/catch.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Degrade + console warning
     [38;5;246mFalls back like the first option, but logs a warning so the failure is visible in devtools.[39m
  [38;5;246m4. Type something.[39m
